 Will Stop at Nothing</strong></u><br>No matter how big or fierce you foes are, they will bleed out for the crimes commited against you. You will be heard. And they will be dead.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371040/extras/e15c487ccf3eac1fc4755cc6633b00b1.poster.avif?t=1721264711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371040/extras/e15c487ccf3eac1fc4755cc6633b00b1.webm?t=1721264711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371040/extras/e15c487ccf3eac1fc4755cc6633b00b1.mp4?t=1721264711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>There's Always More</strong></u><br>Find arcade minigames, pets, abilities, secrets, characters, and more!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371040/extras/732a0ee3a2122eb5977f59801a3d22dd.poster.avif?t=1721264711\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371040/extras/732a0ee3a2122eb5977f59801a3d22dd.webm?t=1721264711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371040/extras/732a0ee3a2122eb5977f59801a3d22dd.mp4?t=1721264711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
